---
interface Props {
  entries: number;
  guides: number;
  pillars: number;
  lastVerified: string;
}
const { entries, guides, pillars, lastVerified } = Astro.props;
---

<div class="trust-panel">
  <div class="trust-stat">
    <span class="trust-num">{entries}</span>
    <span class="trust-label">条核对过的门道</span>
  </div>
  <div class="trust-stat">
    <span class="trust-num">{guides}</span>
    <span class="trust-label">篇跨支柱攻略</span>
  </div>
  <div class="trust-stat">
    <span class="trust-num">{pillars}</span>
    <span class="trust-label">个钱 / 道支柱</span>
  </div>
  <div class="trust-stat">
    <span class="trust-num">{lastVerified}</span>
    <span class="trust-label">全站最后核对</span>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="trust-rules">
  <div class="trust-rule">
    <h3>只认官方入口</h3>
    <p>每条钱/道都尽量给官方链接；没有官方来源的，明确标出是经验整理。</p>
  </div>
  <div class="trust-rule">
    <h3>写清核对日期</h3>
    <p>记录最后核对月份和下次复核时间，过期自动降级提示，不装作还新鲜。</p>
  </div>
  <div class="trust-rule">
    <h3>过期只标记，不删除</h3>
    <p>政策会变，但历史信息仍有参考价值；过期条目保留并标注，不静默消失。</p>
  </div>
</div>
